  "description": "Mediadesign University of Applied Sciences was one of the first universities in Germany to establish degree programmes in game design, film animation and digital media. Since the 1990s, we have focused on innovative teaching formats and technological integration - from satellite teaching to AI-supported learning. This early focus has made us a pioneer for future-oriented degree programmes at the interface of creativity and technology. Study where innovation happens: Our campus locations in Düsseldorf at the Media Harbour and in the center of Berlin offer an inspiring environment with state-of-the-art facilities - perfect for creative work and networking. Timestamps Updated",
